'''Bronze Icebreaker''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] [[:Category:Knives|knife]] that was awarded to the player who finished '''3rd''' on the [[Christmas Event 2020|2020 Christmas Event]] '''Coin-Collecting''' Leaderboard.

== Appearance ==
The Bronze Icebreaker has the same design as [[Icebreaker]], but its dominant colors are replaced with a bronze and black.

== Trivia ==
*During the [[Christmas Event 2020|2020 Christmas Event]], there were 2 different leaderboards; '''Gift-Giving''' and '''Coin-Collecting'''.
*In order to obtain this item, participants collect as many [[Snow Tokens|'''Winter Tokens''']] (act exactly like [[coins]]) in order to score points which will determine their rank in the leaderboard.
*Other variants of this include [[Red Icebreaker]], [[Silver Icebreaker]], and [[Gold Icebreaker]].
*This item is a bronze reskin of [[Icebreaker]], an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife.
*This item is [[Trading|untradable]].
*The sole owner of this item is [https://www.roblox.com/users/911591004/profile '''Avwwie'''].

